<title>USA: IPO FILING - First Aviation Services Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - First Aviation Services Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 First Aviation Services Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			FAVS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,750,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Smith Barney Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  585,000 shrs Business: The Stamford, Conn., company provides services to operators of some of the most widely used military, commercial and general aviation aircraft engines in the world. Use of Proceeds: To repay indebtedness, to fund cash portion of the API Combs acquisition, to redeem all of the outstanding shares of Series A preferred stock and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial data not available</p>
</text>
